<p>Hey! Thank you so much! First of all, I didn't know of the term &quot;noosphere&quot;, so you've introduced me to some new reading material. Second, thanks for linking me to that guide. I think you're right about the complexity, and I should focus on adding more depth to the idea.</p>
<p>As for the nature of the anomaly, I'm going to be honest in saying that I wasn't really thinking about the tree as a symbol of tranquility as much as it being a rather mundane object. However, I think I can see some potential for irony given this symbolism. I definitely will give this more thought.</p>

